/ La carte du domaine (epic #348, phase 1).
  La page N'A PAS d'en-tête : sous la navbar, tout l'écran est la carte. Un
  titre et un fil d'Ariane grignoteraient la seule chose qu'on vient regarder.

- if @base_layer.nil?
  .m-8.rounded-2xl.border.border-dashed.p-8.text-center class="border-amber-300 bg-amber-50/40"
    p.font-averia.text-xl.text-stone-800 Aucun fond de carte n'est installé.
    p.mt-2.text-sm.text-stone-500
      | Les tuiles ne vivent pas dans le dépôt : elles s'installent avec la tâche
      code.mx-1.rounded.bg-stone-100.px-1.py-0.5.text-xs rake map:base_layer:import
      | , qui lit un dossier de tuiles et enregistre la couche.
- else
  / La hauteur vient du layout : en mode carte, le corps de page est une colonne
    flex de `100dvh` (pas `100vh`, que la barre d'adresse d'iOS dépasse) et la
    carte en occupe tout ce qui reste sous la navbar, bord à bord.
  div class="relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden"
    div[class="absolute inset-0"
        data-controller="map"
        data-map-tiles-url-value="/map/tiles/#{@base_layer.key}/{kind}/{z}/{x}/{y}.png"
        data-map-layer-key-value=@base_layer.key
        data-map-bounds-value=(@base_layer.leaflet_bounds || []).to_json
        data-map-center-value=(@base_layer.center || []).to_json
        data-map-min-zoom-value=(@base_layer.min_zoom || 12)
        data-map-max-zoom-value=(@base_layer.max_zoom || 20)
        data-map-has-relief-value=@base_layer.relief?.to_s
        data-map-features-url-value=map_features_path(format: :json)
        data-map-new-feature-url-value=new_map_feature_path
        data-map-occupancy-url-value=map_occupancy_path(format: :json)
        data-map-venue-url-value=map_venue_path(id: "__ID__")
        data-map-date-value=@date.iso8601
        data-map-today-value=Date.current.iso8601
        data-map-focus-feature-value=@focus_feature_id
        data-map-current-tasks-url-value=map_tasks_current_path(format: :json)
        data-map-plant-url-value=plant_path(id: "__ID__")
        data-map-focus-plant-value=@focus_plant_id
        data-map-unplaced-url-value=unplaced_plants_path
        data-map-place-url-value=place_plant_path(id: "__ID__")
        data-map-unplace-url-value=unplace_plant_path(id: "__ID__")]

      / Le fond de la carte hors emprise : uni, couleur `sand` du thème. Pas
        d'OpenStreetMap ni de Google — aucune clé tierce sur cette page.
      div.absolute.inset-0.bg-sand data-map-target="canvas"

      / Panneau des couches. C'est le SQUELETTE que les phases suivantes
        remplissent : aujourd'hui les fonds et le relief, demain les couches
        typées (gestion, plantes, réseaux…).
      div[class="absolute left-3 top-3 z-[1000] w-64 max-w-[calc(100vw-1.5rem)] rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/95 shadow-lg backdrop-blur"
          data-map-target="panel"]
        button[type="button"
               class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-left"
               data-action="click->map#togglePanel"
               aria-expanded="true"
               data-map-target="panelToggle"]
          svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"
            polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"
            polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"
          span.flex-1.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-700 Couches
          svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-400.transition-transform data-map-target="panelChevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"

        div.border-t.border-stone-100.px-3.py-3 data-map-target="panelBody"
          p class="mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400" Fonds
          ul.space-y-1
            - @base_layers.each do |couche|
              li
                = link_to map_path(base_layer_id: couche.id), class: "flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors #{couche.id == @base_layer.id ? 'bg-teal-50 text-4s-main font-medium' : 'text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50'}" do
                  span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full #{couche.id == @base_layer.id ? 'bg-4s-main' : 'border border-stone-300'}"
                  span.flex-1.truncate = couche.name
                  - if couche.captured_on
                    span class="text-[0.65rem] tabular-nums text-stone-400" = l(couche.captured_on, format: "%m/%Y")

          - if @base_layer.relief?
            .mt-3.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3
              label.flex.cursor-pointer.items-center.gap-2.text-sm.text-stone-600
                input[type="checkbox" class="rounded border-stone-300 text-4s-main focus:ring-teal-400" data-action="change->map#toggleRelief" data-map-target="reliefToggle"]
                span Relief

          / Les couches typées (phase 2). La case affiche ou masque ; le nom rend
            la couche ACTIVE — c'est elle que la barre d'outils édite.
          .mt-3.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3
            p class="mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400" Couches
            ul.space-y-1
              - @layers.each do |couche|
                li.flex.items-center.gap-2 data-layer-id=couche.id data-layer-kind=couche.kind
                  input[type="checkbox" checked=true
                        class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-stone-300 text-4s-main focus:ring-teal-400"
                        aria-label="Afficher #{couche.name}"
                        data-map-target="layerToggle"
                        data-layer-id=couche.id
                        data-action="change->map#toggleLayer"]
                  button[type="button"
                         class="flex-1 truncate rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50"
                         data-map-target="layerName"
                         data-layer-id=couche.id
                         data-layer-kind=couche.kind
                         data-action="click->map#activateLayer"]
                    = couche.name
                / Commentaires (phase 11) : le filtre des fils résolus, et
                  l'adresse de la fiche d'un nouveau commentaire.
                - if couche.kind == "comments"
                  li.pl-6 data-new-comment-url=new_map_comment_path
                    label.flex.cursor-pointer.items-center.gap-2.py-1.text-xs.text-stone-500
                      input[type="checkbox"
                            class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-stone-300 text-4s-main focus:ring-teal-400"
                            data-comments-filter="true"
                            data-action="change->map#toggleResolvedComments"]
                      span Masquer les résolus

            / Les gîtes et salles pas encore tracés (phase 3) : la carte du jour
              ne colore que ce qui est dessiné, on n'en oublie aucun. Rechargée
              par la carte après chaque enregistrement.
            = turbo_frame_tag "map_venues_todo", src: map_venues_todo_path, data: { map_target: "venuesTodo" }

          / Les plantes nourricières (phase 7) : le mode Placement et les pages
            annexes (récoltes, liste, espèces).
          .mt-3.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3 data-map-plants-section="true"
            p class="mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400" Plantes
            button[type="button"
                   class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50"
                   data-action="map#openPlacement"
                   data-map-placement-link="true"]
              svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                path d="M12 22s7-6.1 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5.9 7 12 7 12z"
                path d="M12 7v6M9 10h6"
              span.flex-1 À placer
              span[class="min-w-[1.5rem] rounded-full bg-ember px-1.5 py-0.5 text-center text-[0.7rem] font-semibold tabular-nums text-white #{'hidden' if @unplaced_count.zero?}"
                   data-map-target="unplacedCount"]
                = @unplaced_count
            = link_to map_recoltes_path, class: "flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50", data: { map_recoltes_link: true } do
              svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                path d="M12 22c4-2 7-6 7-11a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 5 3 9 7 11z"
                path d="M12 4c0-1 1-2 3-2"
              span.flex-1 Récoltes
            = link_to map_plantes_path, class: "flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50", data: { map_plantes_link: true } do
              svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"
              span.flex-1 Toutes les plantes
            = link_to map_especes_path, class: "flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50", data: { map_especes_link: true } do
              svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10z"
                path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6"
              span.flex-1 Espèces
          / Le carnet de gestion (phase 6) : les tâches des objets, mois par mois.
          .mt-3.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3
            p class="mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400" Gestion
            = link_to map_carnet_path, class: "flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50", data: { map_carnet_link: true } do
              svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-500 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"
                path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"
              span.flex-1 Carnet
            / Vue « ce mois-ci » : les objets à travailler ce mois-ci ressortent,
              les autres s'estompent.
            label.mt-1.flex.cursor-pointer.items-center.gap-2.px-2.py-1.5.text-sm.text-stone-600
              input[type="checkbox"
                    class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-stone-300 text-4s-main focus:ring-teal-400"
                    data-map-month-toggle="true"
                    data-action="change->map#toggleMonthFocus"]
              span.flex-1 Ce mois-ci
              span class="text-[0.65rem] text-stone-400" = MapTask.month_name(Date.current.month).downcase
          / Les notes manuscrites (phase 12).
          = render "maps/sketches_panel"

      / Barre des notes manuscrites (phase 12), visible quand un dessin est actif.
      = render "maps/sketch_toolbar"

      / Barre d'outils du mode Gestion (phase 2) : visible quand la couche
        active est de kind `management`. Les outils sont ceux de Geoman.
      div[class="absolute left-1/2 top-3 z-[1000] hidden -translate-x-1/2 items-center gap-1 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/95 p-1 shadow-lg backdrop-blur"
          data-map-target="toolbar"
          role="toolbar"
          aria-label="Outils de la couche Gestion"]
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 transition-colors hover:bg-forest-tint hover:text-forest"
               title="Point"
               aria-label="Point"
               aria-pressed="false"
               data-map-target="tool"
               data-tool="CircleMarker"
               data-tool-kinds="management welcome"
               data-action="click->map#useTool"]
          svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"
            path d="M12 21s-7-6.5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.5-7 11-7 11z"
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 transition-colors hover:bg-forest-tint hover:text-forest"
               title="Ligne (accès)"
               aria-label="Ligne (accès)"
               aria-pressed="false"
               data-map-target="tool"
               data-tool="Line"
               data-tool-kinds="management welcome"
               data-action="click->map#useTool"]
          svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            polyline points="4 18 10 10 14 14 20 6"
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 transition-colors hover:bg-forest-tint hover:text-forest"
               title="Zone"
               aria-label="Zone"
               aria-pressed="false"
               data-map-target="tool"
               data-tool="Polygon"
               data-action="click->map#useTool"]
          svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            polygon points="5 7 12 3 19 8 17 18 7 18"
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 transition-colors hover:bg-forest-tint hover:text-forest"
               title="Déplacer / éditer les sommets"
               aria-label="Déplacer / éditer les sommets"
               aria-pressed="false"
               data-map-target="tool"
               data-tool="edit"
               data-action="click->map#useTool"]
          svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            path d="M5 9 2 12l3 3M9 5l3-3 3 3M15 19l-3 3-3-3M19 9l3 3-3 3M2 12h20M12 2v20"
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 transition-colors hover:bg-forest-tint hover:text-forest"
               title="Supprimer"
               aria-label="Supprimer"
               aria-pressed="false"
               data-map-target="tool"
               data-tool="remove"
               data-action="click->map#useTool"]
          svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            path d="M3 6h18"
            path d="M19 6v14c0 1-1 2-2 2H7c-1 0-2-1-2-2V6"
            path d="M8 6V4c0-1 1-2 2-2h4c1 0 2 1 2 2v2"

      / La carte du jour (phase 3) : le jour affiché, en bas au centre, à portée
        de pouce sur un téléphone. Visible tant que la couche des lieux l'est.
      div[class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 z-[1000] hidden -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-1.5"
          data-map-target="dateBar"]
        .flex.items-center.gap-1.rounded-xl.border.border-stone-200.bg-white/95.p-1.shadow-lg.backdrop-blur
          button[type="button"
                 class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-100"
                 aria-label="Jour précédent"
                 data-action="click->map#previousDay"]
            svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
              polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"
          label.relative.flex.h-11.cursor-pointer.flex-col.justify-center.px-2.text-center
            span.whitespace-nowrap.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-800 data-map-target="dateLabel" = l(@date, format: "%A %-d %B").upcase_first
            span class="text-[0.65rem] text-stone-400" data-map-target="dateHint" = @date == Date.current ? "aujourd'hui" : ""
            input[type="date"
                  class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0"
                  aria-label="Choisir le jour"
                  value=@date.iso8601
                  data-map-target="dateInput"
                  data-action="change->map#pickDate"]
          button[type="button"
                 class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-100"
                 aria-label="Jour suivant"
                 data-action="click->map#nextDay"]
            svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
              polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"
        button[type="button"
               class="hidden rounded-full bg-forest px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow"
               data-map-target="todayButton"
               data-action="click->map#goToday"]
          | Aujourd'hui
        .flex.items-center.gap-3.rounded-full.bg-white/90.px-3.py-1.text-xs.text-stone-600.shadow
          span.flex.items-center.gap-1
            span.inline-block.h-2.5.w-2.5.rounded-sm.bg-ember
            | Occupé
          span.flex.items-center.gap-1
            span.inline-block.h-2.5.w-2.5.rounded-sm style="background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #C97B3D 0 2px, #E4EEEA 2px 4px)"
            | Arrivée / départ
          span.flex.items-center.gap-1
            span class="inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-sm border border-forest/40 bg-forest-tint"
            | Libre

      / Légende de la couche Accueil (phase 4), visible quand elle est active :
        les mêmes couleurs que sur la page publique des hôtes.
      = render "maps/welcome_legend", html_class: "absolute bottom-6 left-3 z-[1000] hidden",
                                      data: { "map-target" => "welcomeLegend" },
                                      labels: MapFeature::ACCESS_LEVELS

      / La fiche latérale d'un objet (Turbo Frame). À droite sur grand écran,
        plein écran sous 768 px. Masquée tant qu'elle est vide.
      div[class="fixed inset-0 z-[1100] hidden md:absolute md:inset-auto md:bottom-3 md:right-3 md:top-3 md:w-96"
          data-map-target="panelContainer"]
        = turbo_frame_tag "feature_panel", class: "block h-full", data: { map_target: "featureFrame" }

      / Le mode Placement (phase 7). Le tiroir liste les plantes à placer : en
        feuille basse sur un téléphone (la carte reste visible au-dessus), à
        gauche sur grand écran. Le bandeau dit quelle plante on pose et porte
        « Je suis devant » (GPS).
      div[class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-[1050] hidden max-h-[42dvh] flex-col rounded-t-2xl border-t border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-2xl md:absolute md:inset-x-auto md:bottom-3 md:left-3 md:top-3 md:max-h-[none] md:w-80 md:rounded-xl md:border"
          data-map-target="placementDrawer"
          role="dialog"
          aria-label="Placer des plantes"]
        .pt-2.md:hidden aria-hidden="true"
          span.mx-auto.block.h-1.w-10.rounded-full.bg-stone-200
        .flex.items-center.gap-2.border-b.border-stone-100.px-3.py-1.md:py-2
          span.flex-1.font-averia.text-lg.text-stone-800 Placer des plantes
          span[class="min-w-[1.5rem] rounded-full bg-ember px-1.5 py-0.5 text-center text-xs font-semibold tabular-nums text-white #{'hidden' if @unplaced_count.zero?}"
               data-map-target="unplacedCount"]
            = @unplaced_count
          button[type="button"
                 class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-500 hover:bg-stone-50"
                 data-action="map#closePlacement"
                 aria-label="Fermer le tiroir"]
            svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
              path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"
        .min-h-0.flex-1.overflow-y-auto.overscroll-contain
          = turbo_frame_tag PlantsController::UNPLACED_FRAME, data: { map_target: "unplacedFrame" } do
            p.px-4.py-6.text-center.text-sm.text-stone-400 Chargement…

      div[class="absolute left-1/2 top-3 z-[1060] hidden w-[min(94vw,30rem)] -translate-x-1/2 md:left-[21.5rem] md:right-[25.5rem] md:mx-auto md:w-auto md:max-w-[30rem] md:translate-x-0 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/95 shadow-xl backdrop-blur"
          data-map-target="placementBanner"
          data-placement-banner="true"
          role="status"
          aria-live="polite"]
        .flex.items-start.gap-2.p-3.pb-2
          .min-w-0.flex-1
            p.text-sm.leading-snug.text-stone-800 data-map-target="placementMessage"
            p.mt-0.5.text-xs.text-stone-500 data-map-target="placementHint"
          button[type="button"
                 class="-mr-1 -mt-1 flex h-11 w-11 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-500 hover:bg-stone-50"
                 data-action="map#cancelPlacement"
                 aria-label="Annuler (Échap)"
                 title="Annuler (Échap)"]
            svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
              path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"
        .flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.px-3.pb-3
          button[type="button"
                 class="flex h-11 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-forest px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-forest hover:bg-forest-tint md:flex-none"
                 data-map-target="placementGps"
                 data-action="map#placementGps"]
            | Je suis devant
          button[type="button"
                 class="flex hidden h-11 flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-forest px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white"
                 data-map-target="placementGpsConfirm"
                 data-action="map#confirmGpsPlacement"]
        / La dernière plante posée : on la corrige, on l'ouvre, ou on annule.
        div.flex.hidden.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-1.border-t.border-stone-100.px-3.py-2 data-map-target="placementLast"
          svg.h-4.w-4.text-forest xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
            path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"
          span.min-w-0.flex-1.truncate.text-xs.text-stone-600 data-map-target="placementLastMessage"
